title: 'Gnomon 8.0.1: orchestration Phase 0 closes, loops ship disabled for testers'
summary: Resumed from the day-2 checkpoint. Arky broke orchestration Phase 0 into briefs; builders built the turn.economy fold and the routing backfill; Aegis and a Loid-lens reviewer found the baselines not yet pre-registerable and the fixes landed. The founder then chose to pause at the closure point and release for testers, with loops disabled (TD-2026-10-24-447). Built the loops gate (kernel + GUI), Aegis found a build-pipeline gap (nothing verified the staged kernel is a release build), fixed with assertReleaseKernel. Mika approved the loops-off UI with fixes (hidden stale cards were still counted). Versions bumped to 8.0.1 with the 8.0.0 skip explained in the CHANGELOG. Probes P1-P4 and the item 4 emitters are deferred.
symbols_touched:
  - '#turn-economy'
  - '#loops-gate'
